  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Add basmati rice, the water (for rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62d9fb6a3134e720e60b3cf5/step-4b05091a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice cooking, finely chop or crush garlic. Roughly chop tomato. Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons.\n• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook zucchini and carrot, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add garlic, cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add soy sauce and stir to combine Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62d9fb6a3134e720e60b3cf5/step-2972a595.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are cooking, cut haloumi into bite-sized chunks.\n• Wipe out and return frying pan to medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi, turning occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 mins.\n• Stir in tomato and South Asian curry spice blend, cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in coconut milk, the water (for curry), salt, brown sugar and veggies, cook until slightly reduced, 2-4 mins. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62d9fb6a3134e720e60b3cf5/step-548d8b18.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice between bowls.\n• Top with Sri Lankan coconut haloumi curry and crushed peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62d9fb6a3134e720e60b3cf5/step-26a8212b.jpg"
    }
  ]
